{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ecf8cff6-b2bb-8af0-99a0-7e4c5a94ebdc",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T13:25:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Omar Kim. I have a note here in front of me so I get the details right. I'm calling about a bulk pickup that didn't happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Kim. Bulk pickup, so like furniture, a mattress, that kind of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A couch and two chairs. My tenant moved out at the end of last month and I put it all out on the curb. Well, I'm the landlord, so I put it out. It was supposed to go last Friday, and it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. And what address is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "365 Kingston Avenue. That's on Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "365 Kingston Avenue, got it. And you said last Friday they didn't take it. Was that the first time they missed it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. It's the second miss in a row. The Friday before, nothing, and then last Friday, nothing again. Today is Friday and I looked this morning and it's still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, did you call in ahead to schedule the bulk item pickup, or did you just put it out with the regular trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I thought I was supposed to just put it out on my trash day. Is there a separate thing? My note only says trash day, which is Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There can be a separate step for large items, yes. Let me put in a request with your address so a crew checks it. So, the couch and two chairs at 365 Kingston, left at the curb. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Wait, so I should have called first? I'm a little unsure what the rule is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it as a missed pickup and ask the supervisor to confirm whether it needs to be scheduled. Someone can call you back. Is the number you're on a good one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-nine-three, perfect. I have that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One more thing, if you don't mind. Do you happen to know of a good tailor? I need to find someone to hem some trousers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can't really recommend one from here. A search for tailors in Newport should give you a few with reviews."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I'll do that. And you'll have someone call me about the couch, and whether I did it wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, you'll get a call. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Kim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T13:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
